 1774                     ; ALL "RESERVED" WORDS ARE TRANSLATED INTO SINGLE
 1775                     ; BYTES WITH THE MSB ON. THIS SAVES SPACE AND TIME
 1776                     ; BY ALLOWING FOR TABLE DISPATCH DURING EXECUTION.
