 1944                     ; STKINI RESETS THE STACK POINTER ELIMINATING
 1945                     ; GOSUB AND FOR CONTEXT. STRING TEMPORARIES ARE FREED
 1946                     ; UP, SUBFLG IS RESET. CONTINUING IS PROHIBITED.
