 2132                     SUBTTL	NEW STATEMENT FETCHER.
 2133                     ;
 2134                     ; BACK HERE FOR NEW STATEMENT. CHARACTER POINTED TO BY TXTPTR
 2135                     ; IS ":" OR END-OF-LINE. THE ADDRESS OF THIS LOC IS LEFT
