 2370                     ;
 2371                     ; A GOSUB ENTRY ON THE STACK HAS THE FOLLOWING FORMAT:
 2372                     ;
 2373                     ; LOW ADDRESS:
 2374                     ;	THE GOSUTK ONE BYTE
 2375                     ;	THE LINE NUMBER OF THE GOSUB STATEMENT TWO BYTES
 2376                     ;	A POINTER INTO THE TEXT OF THE GOSUB TWO BYTES
 2377                     ;
 2378                     ; HIGH ADDRESS.
 2379                     ;
 2380                     ; TOTAL FIVE BYTES.
