 6288                     SUBTTL	POLYNOMIAL EVALUATOR AND THE RANDOM NUMBER GENERATOR.
 6289                     	;EVALUATE P(X^2)*X
 6290                     	;POINTER TO DEGREE IS IN [Y,A].
 6291                     	;THE CONSTANTS FOLLOW THE DEGREE.
 6292                     	;FOR X=FAC, COMPUTE:
 6293                     	; C0*X+C1*X^3+C2*X^5+C3*X^7+...+C(N)*X^(2*N+1)
 6294  EDCA  85 B0 84 B1  POLYX:	STWD	POLYPT		;RETAIN POLYNOMIAL POINTER FOR LATER.
