 6330                     	;PSUEDO-RANDOM NUMBER GENERATOR.
 6331                     	;IF ARG=0, THE LAST RANDOM NUMBER GENERATED IS RETURNED.
 6332                     	;IF ARG .LT. 0, A NEW SEQUENCE OF RANDOM NUMBERS IS
 6333                     	;STARTED USING THE ARGUMENT.
 6334                     	;   TO FORM THE NEXT RANDOM NUMBER IN THE SEQUENCE,
 6335                     	;MULTIPLY THE PREVIOUS RANDOM NUMBER BY A RANDOM CONSTANT
 6336                     	;AND ADD IN ANOTHER RANDOM CONSTANT. THE THEN HO
 6337                     	;AND LO BYTES ARE SWITCHED, THE EXPONENT IS PUT WHERE
 6338                     	;IT WILL BE SHIFTED IN BY NORMAL, AND THE EXPONENT IN THE FAC
 6339                     	;IS SET TO 200 SO THE RESULT WILL BE LESS THAN 1. THIS
 6340                     	;IS THEN NORMALIZED AND SAVED FOR THE NEXT TIME.
 6341                     	;THE HO AND LOW BYTES WERE SWITCHED SO THERE WILL BE A
 6342                     	;RANDOM CHANCE OF GETTING A NUMBER LESS THAN OR GREATER
 6343                     	;THAN .5 .
 6345  EE14  98           RMULZC: 230
 6346  EE15  35           	065
 6347  EE16  44           	104
 6348  EE17  7A           	172
 6349  EE18  68           RADDZC: 150
